        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/steam-controller-header.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>Perhaps the greatest compliment I can give Valve's new Steam Controller is that in the week or so I've been using it, I haven't really thought about it much at all. With its heavily Steam-Deck-inspired design, it improves on the original Steam Controller in almost every way - and it's certainly vastly more convincing as an everyday controller - but the things it does best are specific enough that, even with those upgrades, it remains a bit of a niche proposition.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/steam-controller-review\">Read more</a></p>",
