        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/Alien-Isolation_Amanda-Ripley_custom.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>Late 2024 gave us <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/alien-isolation-2-teased-by-creative-assembly-with-original-director-returning\">the long-awaited news</a> that a sequel to 2014's <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/alien-isolation-review\">Alien: Isolation</a> was finally entering development. Developer Creative Assembly and publisher Sega have been quiet since then, with most people assuming the game has been slowly going through the early phases of development before production ramps up in earnest. Yesterday, which was Alien Day 2026, things changed.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/alien-isolation-sequel-first-teaser\">Read more</a></p>",
